        "title": "Handle the Variables with Negative Exponents",
        "text": "For division, subtract exponents:\n\nFor $a$: $a^{-2} \\div a^3 = a^{-2-3} = a^{-5}$\n\nFor $b$: $b^3 \\div b^{-1} = b^{3-(-1)} = b^{3+1} = b^4$",
        "variabilization": {},
        "oer": "DBE NSC Paper 1",
        "license": "Public Domain"
